			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihasini tayyorlashda manfaatdor tashkilotlar vakillari, olimlar va jamoatchilik vakillarini keng jalb qilish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihasini ishlab chiqish boʻyicha ishchi guruhlar tarkibiga ushbu loyiha manfaatlariga daxl qilishi mumkin boʻlgan soha, tashkilotlar mutaxassislarini, olimlar va jamoatchilik vakillarini ham taklif qilish amaliyotini yoʻlga qoʻyish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot, normativ-huquqiy hujjat loyihasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil may</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
