			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">II. Tartibga solish yukini va ortiqcha byurokratik toʻsiqlarni kamaytirish hisobiga huquqni qoʻllash amaliyotini soddalashtirish, barcha uchun qulay boʻlgan sodda va ixcham qonunchilik tizimini yaratish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">5.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Tarqoq qonun va qonunosti hujjatlarni yaxlit qonunga birlashtirish, kodifikatsiyalash boʻyicha ishlarni jadallashtirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Qonun hujjatlarini kodifikatsiyalash boʻyicha boshlangan ishlarni tanqidiy tahlil qilish, kodifikatsiyalashga toʻsqinlik qilayotgan omillarni aniqlash, ularni bartaraf etish, kodifikatsiyalash ishlarini yanada kengaytirish boʻyicha ishchi guruh tashkil etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot, chora-tadbirlar dasturi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil mart</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis palatalari,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshqulov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

