			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Qonunlarni kodifikatsiyalash boʻyicha 2030-yilgacha moʻljallangan chora-tadbirlar dasturini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
