			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">6.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Tartibga solish yukini va ortiqcha byurokratik toʻsiqlarni kamaytirishda parlament nazorati taʼsirchanligini oshirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis Qonunchilik palatasi qoʻmitalari tomonidan vazirliklarning oʻz yoʻnalishlarida qonunchilikdagi <b>byurokratik toʻsiqlarni yanada qisqartirish</b> yuzasidan amalga oshirgan ishlari boʻyicha hisobotlarini eshitib borish va natijalari boʻyicha takliflar kiritish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Amaliy chora-tadbirlar, axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil may, oktyabr</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td colspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis Qonunchilik palatasi qoʻmitalari</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">III. Qonun ijodkorligi jarayonida fuqarolik jamiyati institutlari, ilmiy hamjamiyat vakillari va siyosiy partiyalarning ishtirokini yanada kuchaytirish, ular bilan maslahatlashuvlar oʻtkazish amaliyotini takomillashtirish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">7.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a name="_Hlk135408970"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihalarini ishlab chiqish va koʻrib chiqish jarayonlarida ekspertlar va ilmiy hamjamiyat vakillarini keng jalb qilish, fuqarolik jamiyati institutlari bilan maslahatlashuvlar oʻtkazish amaliyotini takomillashtirish</span></span></span></a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Qonun loyihalarini ishlab chiqishning barcha bosqichida, shuningdek qonun loyihalarining qoʻmitalar va fraksiyalar tomonidan koʻrib chiqilishida ekspertlar va ilmiy hamjamiyat vakillari bilan maslahatlashish, ularning salohiyati va ilmiy ishlanmalaridan keng foydalanish amaliyotini kengaytirish. Shu maqsadda qoʻmitalar huzuridagi ekspertlar guruhlari tarkibini qayta koʻrib chiqish va ularning sonini maqbullashtirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Amaliy chora-tadbirlar</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">2024-yil aprel</span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis palatalari qoʻmitalari</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Qonun ijodkorligi jarayonida fuqarolik jamiyati institutlari bilan maslahatlashuvlar oʻtkazishni yangicha tartibini joriy etish. </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Bunda har bir qoʻmitada tegishli soha boʻyicha qonunlarni koʻrib chiqishda qoʻmita bilan hamkorlik qiladigan nodavlat notijorat tashkilotlari roʻyxati yuritiladi. Qoʻmitaga kelib tushgan qonunlar tegishli NNTlarga ham koʻrib chiqish va taklif berish uchun yuboriladi hamda ularning qonun loyihasi boʻyicha fikri qoʻmita, fraksiya va palata majlislarida oʻqib eshittiriladi.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasi qarori</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil mart</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasining</span></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black"> Demokratik institutlar, nodavlat tashkilotlar va fuqarolarning oʻzini oʻzi boshqarish organlari qoʻmitasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(Sh. Bafayev)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">8.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihalarini ishlab chiqishning barcha bosqichida ilmiy-ekspertlik qoʻllab-quvvatlovini taʼminlash.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Qonun ijodkorligi jarayoniga ilmiy va ekspert doiralar vakillari, oliy taʼlim tashkilotlarining ilmiy darajalar olish uchun talabgorlarining qonunchilik va huquqiy tartibga solishni takomillashtirish boʻyicha takliflarni oʻz ichiga olgan ilmiy-tahliliy faoliyati natijalaridan foydalanish uchun aloqa tizimini yoʻlga qoʻyish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Amaliy chora-tadbirlar</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil aprel</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis palatalari qoʻmitalari,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasi Devoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(B. Radjabov</span></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Senat Devoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(Q. Nurullayev)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Qonun ijodkorligi jarayonida faol ishtirok etayotgan olimlar, mu�axassis va ekspertlarni ragʻbatlantirishning tashkiliy-huquqiy, moddiy tartibini takomillashtirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil may</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">IV. Qonun ijodkorligida jamoatchilik muhokamasi tizimini takomillashtirish, barcha muhim huquqiy hujjatlar bevosita aholi bilan muloqot asosida, jamoatchilik fikrini hisobga olgan holda qabul qilinishini taʼminlash</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">9.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a name="_Hlk135409301"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Jamoatchilikning qonun loyihalarini koʻrib chiqish jarayonidan xabardorligini oshirish</span></span></span></a><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis Qonunchilik palatasiga kiritilgan qonun loyihalari, shuningdek ularning Oliy Majlis palatalari tomonidan koʻrib chiqilishi holati haqidagi maʼlumotlarni Oliy Majlis Qonunchilik palatasining rasmiy veb-saytida doimiy asosda yangilab borish, real vaqt rejimida takliflar hamda mulohazalarni yoʻllash imkoniyatini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Amaliy chora-tadbirlar</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil dekabr</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasi Devoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(B. Radjabov</span></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">10.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Aholini parlament faoliyati bilan yaqindan tanishtirish, Oliy Majlis palatalari aʼzolarini fuqarolar bilan yanada yaqinlashtirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oliy Majlis palatalari majlislarida aholining ishtirok etishi boʻyicha yangicha mexanizmlarni joriy etish (“Ochiq parlament” tizimi). Bunda Germaniya tajribasi (“Salom Bundestag” loyihasi) misolida parlament majlislarida ishtirok etmoqchi boʻlgan fuqarolarni onlayn roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish va parlament ishiga taklif qilish amaliyoti yoʻlga qoʻyiladi.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasi va Senatning qoʻshma qarori</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil aprel</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasi Devoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(B. Radjabov</span></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Senat Devoni</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(Q. Nurullayev),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Senatning tegishli qoʻmitalari</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">11.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Eng muhim iqtisodiy va ijtimoiy-siyosiy ahamiyatga ega normativ-huquqiy hujjatlar loyihalarini aholi bilan muloqot asosida, jamoatchilik fikrini hisobga olgan holda qabul qilish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Eng muhim iqtisodiy va ijtimoiy-siyosiy ahamiyatga ega normativ-huquqiy hujjatlar, ayniqsa, qonun loyihalarini</span></span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black"> ishlab chiqishdan oldin ularning tayyorlanishi boʻyicha axborotni jamoatchilik muhokamasi portaliga joylashtirish va loyihani jamoatchilik takliflari asosida ishlab chiqish tartibini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Normativ-huquqiy hujjat loyihasi </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil mart</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshqulov)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">12.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihalarining jamoatchilik muhokamasi tizimini takomillashtirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Jamoatchilik muhokamasiga chiqarilayotgan qonun loyihalarining mazmun-mohiyatini aholi uchun sodda va tushunarli tilda izohlab berish amaliyotini yoʻlga qoʻyish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Ishlab chiquvchi tomonidan muhokama ishtirokchilarining takliflari majburiy tarzda koʻrib chiqilishi toʻgʻrisidagi talabga rioya etilishi ustidan nazoratning taʼsirchan mexanizmlarini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">3. Jamoatchilik muhokamasidagi loyihalar boʻyicha bildirilayotgan takliflarga munosabat bildirib borish tartibini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">4. Qonun ijodkorligi jarayonida jamoatchilik bilan oʻzaro hamkorlik qilishning zamonaviy shakllari va mexanizmlarini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil aprel</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshqulov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">qonunchilik tashabbusi huquqi subyektlari,</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Parlament tadqiqotlari instituti</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshpulatov)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="7" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:100%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">V. Qonun ijodkorligiga “aqlli tartibga solish” modeli elementlari, shu jumladan, tartibga solish taʼsirini baholash tizimini keng joriy qilish hamda qonun loyihalarini ekspertizadan oʻtkazish tizimini takomillashtirish</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">13.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun ijodkorligi jarayonida manfaatdor tomonlar ishtirokini kengaytirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Tadbirkorlik subyektlarining huquq va qonuniy manfaatlariga bevosita daxl qiluvchi qonunlarni ishlab chiqishda soha vakillari takliflarini koʻrib chiqish va ular bilan muhokamalar oʻtkazish amaliyotini keng tatbiq qilish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Amaliy chora-tadbirlar</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil aprel</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(A. Toshqulov),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">qonunchilik tashabbusi huquqi subyektlari</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">14.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihalari boʻyicha tartibga solish taʼsirini baholash institutini qoʻllash doi�asini kengaytirish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Oliy Majlis Qonunchilik palatasiga qonun loyihasini kiritishda loyiha boʻyicha tartibga solish taʼsirini baholash xulosasi majburiy tarzda ilova qilish talabini belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Qonun kuchga kirib, besh yildan soʻng masʼul davlat organi va Oliy Majlis palatalarining masʼul qoʻmitalari tomonidan qonun samaradorligini, oʻz maqsadi va kutilgan natijalariga erishilganligini aniqlash maqsadida uning taʼsirini baholash tartibini joriy etish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Axborot-tahliliy maʼlumot, normativ-huquqiy hujjat loyihasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="color:black">2024-yil avgust</span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Adliya vazirligi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

