			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">23.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><a name="_Hlk135408762"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oʻzbekistonning tinchliksevar tashqi siyosatini amalga oshirishni qonuniy mustahkamlash.</span></span></span></a></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Oʻzbekiston va jahon hamjamiyati, qoʻshni davlatlar bilan doʻstona munosabatlarni “davlatlarning hududiy yaxlitligi” va “tinchliksevar tashqi siyosat” prinsiplari asosida rivojlantirishga doir konstitutsiyaviy normalarni Oʻzbekiston Respublikasining tashqi siyosiy faoliyati konsepsiyasiga kiritish boʻyicha qonun loyihasini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonun loyihasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil aprel</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunchilik palatasining Xalqaro ishlar va parlamentlararo aloqalar qoʻmitasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(D. Fayziyeva),</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Senatning Xalqaro munosabatlar, tashqi iqtisodiy aloqalar, xorijiy investitsiyalar va turizm masalalari qoʻmitasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">(R. Alimov)</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:none;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none;width:0%">
			<p style="margin-bottom:11px"></p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:2%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif">24.</span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:25%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Qonunlardagi havolaki normalarni amalga oshirish mexanizmlarini belgilash.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:33%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">1. Soʻnggi yillarda qabul qilingan yaxlit qonunlarni tahlil qilgan holda ulardagi havolaki normalarni aniqlash va ularning amalga oshirilganlik holatini oʻrganish. </span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

			<p style="text-align:justify;text-indent:15.45pt"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2. Qonunlardagi amalga oshirilmagan havolaki normalarni realizatsiya qilish boʻyicha chora-tadbirlar dasturini ishlab chiqish.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:9%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">Normativ-huquqiy hujjat loyihasi</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
			<p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span style="color:black">2024-yil fevral</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
			</td>
			<td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:19%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top">
